        "mechanism": "*Price-Pack Architecture (PPA)* in General Trade. At \"magic price points\" (Rs 5), consumer retail price cannot be moved without immediate volume collapse. Margin defense must be executed through stealth grammage reduction (e.g., dropping from 45g to 38g at Rs 5) while Reliance attempts to subsidize primary distributor margins (offering 8–10% vs. industry standard 4–5%) via corporate group cash flow.",
