        "mechanism": "Overcoming the D2C CAC Trap. As online advertising costs inflated, Honasa shifted its marketing budget into offline Trade Promotion Spend (TPS) and sales-route incentives. It optimized distributor ROIC (`Net Margin % x Inventory Turns`) by strictly enforcing a 14-day credit cycle and regional super-stockist inventory rebalancing.",
